clauses.text:
The insured must submit the following verified documents for claim processing:
(a) Fully completed and signed Claim Form;
(b) Self-attested copy of valid Driving License of the person driving at the time of accident;
(c) Copy of Vehicle Registration Certificate (RC Book);
(d) Original Itemized Repair Estimate / Invoice from workshop;
(e) For Theft/Major Accidents: Certified copy of First Information Report (FIR) registered with Police;
(f) For Theft Claims: Original vehicle keys (both sets) and Police Non-Traceable Report.
